From 4a3def269eed22ada69be13ec385112a721b6e63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick Nassiri <nick@knnlabs.com>
Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 11:02:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 15/16] Carbonyl: M148 build adaptations

Final round of fixes needed to make the carbonyl patch series compile
and link against Chromium M148 after the bulk rebase in patches 1-14.

Key adaptations grouped by file:

* third_party/blink/public/web/carbonyl_text_capture.h
  third_party/blink/renderer/core/exported/carbonyl_text_capture.cc
  third_party/blink/renderer/core/exported/build.gni
  third_party/blink/public/BUILD.gn
  content/renderer/render_frame_impl.cc
  Move TextCaptureDevice + RendererService + paint-record replay out
  of content/renderer/ (which can no longer include blink-internal
  headers like web_view_impl.h in M148) and into a Blink-side module
  exposed via a callback-based public API in WebView's public headers.
  Adapted the M111 Skia API: createDevice returns sk_sp<SkDevice>,
  drawDevice takes SkDevice* (was SkBaseDevice*), onDrawGlyphRunList
  takes a single SkPaint, drawPath/drawVertices/drawPoints signatures
  rewrote for M148, SkAutoSTArray -> skia_private::AutoSTArray,
  localToDevice() now returns SkMatrix while getRelativeTransform
  returns SkM44 (needs asM33()).

* src/browser/host_display_client.{h,cc}
  base/callback.h -> base/functional/callback.h. Dropped unused
  OnPaintCallback typedef and SkBitmap-typed field. Removed
  components/viz/common/resources/{resource_format,resource_sizes}.h
  (moved/removed upstream). Gated DidCompleteSwapWithNewSize on
  SUPPORTS_OZONE_X11 to match parent's gating.

* src/browser/renderer.{h,cc}
  Replaced exit-time-destructor unique_ptr with constinit raw
  pointer (chromium forbids exit-time destructors).
  Replaced C99 VLA in DrawText with std::vector + range-for to
  satisfy unsafe-buffer-usage. RAW_PTR_EXCLUSION on the FFI
  carbonyl_renderer* handle.

* components/viz/service/display_embedder/software_output_device_proxy.cc
  ResourceSizes::MaybeSizeInBytes removed; compute RGBA_8888 byte
  count directly with base::CheckedNumeric. Added bytes_per_row
  argument to CreatePlatformCanvasWithPixels (new in M148). Dropped
  output_device_backing.h (Windows-only d3d11 dep).

* headless/lib/browser/headless_browser_impl.{h,cc}
  Added RunOnStartCallback() declaration. Replaced PlatformStart()
  (gone) with the embedded body. Changed [=] capture to [this] for
  -Wdeprecated-this-capture. Added include for navigation_controller.h,
  native_web_keyboard_event.h. content::NativeWebKeyboardEvent ->
  input::NativeWebKeyboardEvent. PlatformSetWebContentsBounds ->
  SetWebContentsBounds (delegate forwards). Removed unused did_shutdown_
  accessor and browser_main_parts() accessors (no parent in M148).

* headless/lib/browser/headless_web_contents_impl.{h,cc}
  Added content::WebContentsObserver as parent so TitleWasSet/
  DidFinishNavigation/RenderViewReady actually override. Removed
  AddObserver/RemoveObserver/GetDevToolsTarget/AttachClient/IsAttached
  etc - HeadlessWebContents is now a 1-method (Close) interface in
  M148. Added `using WebContentsObserver::OnVisibilityChanged` to
  unhide the parent's overload. zoom::ZoomController dropped (not in
  deps + irrelevant for TUI). Used .value() on ChildProcessId and
  FrameTreeNodeId strong types.

* headless/lib/browser/headless_screen.cc
  carbonyl::Renderer::GetCurrent()->GetDPI() -> carbonyl::Bridge::GetDPI()
  (static, no renderer instance needed).

* third_party/blink/renderer/platform/fonts/font.cc
  base::make_span removed -> base::as_byte_span. CreateSkFont signature
  collapsed to single optional FontDescription* argument.

* third_party/blink/renderer/platform/graphics/compositing/paint_artifact_compositor.cc
  Removed orphaned DescribePaintPropertyNode/DumpWithDifferingPaintPropertiesIncluded
  helpers left after patch 0005 stripped their call sites.

* third_party/blink/renderer/platform/graphics/graphics_context.h
  Removed disable_destruction_checks_ field that patch 0005 commented
  out the body for but left the field declaration of.

* third_party/blink/renderer/core/paint/text_decoration_painter.cc
  Reimplemented PaintUnderOrOverLineDecorations as empty no-op
  (silences carbonyl text decorations without leaving dead code that
  trips -Wunreachable-code).

* third_party/blink/renderer/core/css/resolver/style_resolver.cc
  FontFamily::SetFamily removed -> use FontFamily ctor.
  ExtraExpandedWidthValue() -> kExtraExpandedWidthValue constant.

* ui/compositor/compositor.h
  CompositorDelegate* delegate_ -> raw_ptr<CompositorDelegate> delegate_
  per the chromium-rawptr clang plugin.

* third_party/skia/src/base/SkBase64.h
  Added include/private/base/SkAPI.h (needed because SK_API was used
  without the include in M148's new location for SkBase64).

* third_party/skia/src/core/SkBitmapDevice.cpp
  Single-paint signature for onDrawGlyphRunList (M148 collapse).

* third_party/skia/src/core/SkDevice.h
  SkBaseDevice was renamed to SkDevice; SK_API moved with it.

* headless/BUILD.gn
  Added //components/input dep so input::NativeWebKeyboardEvent links.
